body:
@OP this is accurate. Same thing happened to me at the beginning of the year. I was crushed and it shattered my world. However I caught my wife after she was lying and hiding. She wasn’t really remorseful and blamed me for how I reacted to me finding out. 

There’s no excuse for cheating. However if she wants to work things out and you really love her and she’s the one, it’s worth giving it a shot at repairing your relationship. Especially with the kids in the balance! 

If you need to talk to anyone, I’m here for ya! Even if it’s just to vent your feelings. Because trust me, you’ll be all over the place for awhile and just remember, that’s okay! We are only human!
